Drop custom adapter Python files here.

Each file should contain a class that extends BaseSecurityAdapter:

    from src.integrations.base_adapter import BaseSecurityAdapter, SecurityEvent

    class MyCustomAdapter(BaseSecurityAdapter):
        vendor = "my_vendor"
        product_type = "siem"

        async def _authenticate(self) -> bool:
            # Your auth logic
            return True

        async def get_events(self) -> list[dict]:
            # Pull events from your security product
            return []

        async def health_check(self) -> dict:
            return {"status": "healthy"}

The adapter will be auto-discovered and available in the adapter registry.
